WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.377
The home bench (right) joins with its own team PIN: "Enter team PIN", then "Connect".

2
00:00:06.427 --> 00:00:13.427
The bench sees the score, the sets, its time-outs (TO), substitutions (SUB) and sanctions.

3
00:00:14.929 --> 00:00:17.921
"Time-out": the coach asks the scorer from the tablet.

4
00:00:17.971 --> 00:00:24.971
The scorer sees the request: "Grant time-out".

5
00:00:30.072 --> 00:00:37.072
"Substitution": who goes off, who comes on, then send.

6
00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:43.603
The scorer records it with "Substitute".

7
00:00:43.653 --> 00:00:48.688
The bench follows every rally live. The other team's bench needs its own PIN.
